* column circuit (netlist of sch/column.sch, Xschem with "top level is a .subckt")
*   precharge / equalize : PRE_N = 0 pulls BL and BLB to VDD
*   write switches       : WE = 1 connects BL to D (= DIN) and BLB to DB (= not DIN)
*   sense                : DOUT = not BLB  (= Q of the selected cell)
.subckt column BL BLB PRE_N WE DIN DOUT VDD VSS
MPC1 BL PRE_N VDD VDD pfet w=3.6u l=0.6u
MPC2 BLB PRE_N VDD VDD pfet w=3.6u l=0.6u
MPEQ BL PRE_N BLB VDD pfet w=1.8u l=0.6u
MNW1 BL WE D VSS nfet w=3.6u l=0.6u
MNW2 BLB WE DB VSS nfet w=3.6u l=0.6u
xdrv1 DIN DB VDD VSS inv
xdrv2 DB D VDD VSS inv
xsense BLB DOUT VDD VSS inv
.ends

.subckt inv A Y VDD VSS
M1 Y A VDD VDD pfet w=3.6u l=0.6u
M2 Y A VSS VSS nfet w=1.8u l=0.6u
.ends

